# SQL scripts and schema DDL are kept local only. They contain internal
# database structure and, in the case of training.sql, real employee data.
# Distribute the schema out of band, not through the repository.
*.sql

# KKP report material (methodology, UML diagrams) is local only.
# Anchored to the repo root so docs/ stays tracked.
/kkp/

# Documentation is kept out of the repository; the code is what is published.
*.md

# Reference screenshots kept at the repo root for the report.
# LoginImage.jpeg and bmc2.png are byte-identical duplicates of the assets
# in client/public/, so committing them again would only waste space.
LoginImage.jpeg
bmc2.png
image.png
referencesLogin.png

